{"4369430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mörker", "steam_appid": 4369430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old-school, dark fantasy action FPS inspired by 90s shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a hostile world overrun by cultists, undead, and other horrors. Armed with powerful weapons, survival depends on movement, aim, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments to uncover keys, vital supplies, and hidden secrets. Health and ammo are scarce, rewarding those who venture off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mid-level saves keep tension high, making every encounter matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for players who value tension and classic FPS design, the game delivers a brutal, focused experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old-school, dark fantasy action FPS inspired by 90s shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a hostile world overrun by cultists, undead, and other horrors. Armed with powerful weapons, survival depends on movement, aim, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments to uncover keys, vital supplies, and hidden secrets. Health and ammo are scarce, rewarding those who venture off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mid-level saves keep tension high, making every encounter matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for players who value tension and classic FPS design, the game delivers a brutal, focused experience.</p>", "short_description": "An old-school dark fantasy action FPS. Fight cultists, undead, and other horrors in brutal combat where everything wants you dead.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369430/191fe857e2dc9118c95a9c4a57f7a1f04a0f289c/header.jpg?t=1785975252", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it